WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.950
Media library: photos, videos and files the assistant, flows and automations send to customers (catalogue, portfolio, menu, price list).

2
00:00:12.498 --> 00:00:17.790
Under "Add a file", give it a title, choose the file and click "Upload".

3
00:00:18.344 --> 00:00:27.740
Write a short, clear "Key (English, for automations and AI)"; flows and the AI find the file by this key.

4
00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:35.440
Uploaded files sit in the box of their kind ("Images", "Videos"…); pick them in a flow or automation.

5
00:00:35.992 --> 00:00:42.250
Only add photos you have the right to use; real photos of your own work build the most trust.
